    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukamakazi wa Sheba kayahuliire eiranga lya Solomoni aha byo yabaire akoleire Omukama Ruhanga, aija kumulenga, amubaza ebigumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aija Yerusalemu aina abamushembire bangi muno, n'engamia ezitwete ebirungo n'ezahabu nyingi muno n'obubare bw'eiguzi. Kayagobire Solomoni amubaza byona ebyabaire bimuli aha mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni abimuhorora. Taliho kintu na kimoi ekyalemire Mukama kukimushoborora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama kayaboine obumanyi bwa Solomoni, na nyaruju eyo yayombekire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyakulya ebyo yalyaga, emitulire y'abatwazibe, n'emikolere y'abairube, ebijwaro byabo, abakwasi b'enkorogo, n'ebihongo by'okwokibwa ebyo yahongeraga Rwensinga y'Omukama, agwa omu kitangaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agambira Omukama ati, “Amakuru gawe gona n'obumanyi ebyo nkuhuliireho nkyali owaitu, mazima gonkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbaire ntagaikiliize kuhika orwo nyizire nkabyebonera n'amaisho gange; kandi nobona, n'enusu y'obumanyi bwawe yonkai babaire batagingambiire, kuba bwonene n'eitunga lyawe nibishaga harai amakuru ago mbaire mpuliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakazi bawe baberwa n'abaramata bawe aba nabo baberwa abaikara bemeleire omu maisho gawe bakahulira obumanyi bwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wawe asingizibwe ayakuronkire akakuta aha nketo y'obukama bwa Isiraeli. Omukama akagonza Isiraeli eirai lyona, yakuha obukama obone kubaramura omu mazima n'obugorogoki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukamakazi aha Omukama Solomoni ezahabu y'obusikizi bw'ekilo 4,000 n'omushobyo, n'ebirungo bingi n'obubare bw'eiguzi. Tibyazokire rundi birungo bingi nk'eby'Omukamakazi wa Sheba yahaire Omukama Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi emeli za Hiramu ezaihyaga ezahabu Ofiri, zikaihyayo n'emisandari nyingi muno, n'obubare bw'eiguzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama omu misandari egyo abaijamu enyomyo za Rwensinga y'Omukama n'ez'ekikaare, eningili n'enanga z'abahoyi. Emisandari egyo tiyalesirwe anga tekabonekaga rundi kuhika kir'eki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni aha Omukama wa Sheba byona ebyo yayenzire n'ebyo yamushabire, kandi ebyo yabaire yamutungire amanaganage bitabulimu. Aho Omukama agaruka owabo n'abaramatabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezahabu eyo baleteraga Solomoni omu mwaka gumoi yagobyaga obusikizi bw'ekilo nka 23,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagileterwaga abachuruza n'abatunzi. Eyarugaga omu bakama ba Buarabu n'omu bagavana b'ensi egyo etabulimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni ahesha engabo zihango 200 ezisiigirwe ezahabu. Buli ngabo ekaba esiigirwe ezahabu y'obusikizi bw'ekilo mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ahesha engabo 300 nazo zisiigirwe ezahabu, buli ngabo ekaba esiigirwe ezahabu y'obusikizi bw'ekilo nka ibili. Omukama aziteka omu Nju y'Ekibira kya Lebanoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuba ahanga enketo mpango ey'omwino gw'enjoju agisiiga ezahabu enchenkure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enketo ekaba eina amatembero mukaga, enyuma einayo omutwe gw'enyana, buli rubaju eina ah'okuta emikono, n'entare ibili zikoleirweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi entare 12 zikaba zikoleirwe aha matembero mukaga, buli itembero ntare ibili, oku emoi n'oku emoi. Taliho nketo nk'egi eyabaire erakozirwe mu ngoma yona yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikwato byona eby'okunyoisa eby'Omukama Solomoni bikaba bili by'ezahabu, na byona eby'Enju y'Ekibira kya Lebanoni bikaba bili by'ezahabu nshai. Taliho na kimoi ekyabaire kili ky'efeza, aha rw'okuba efeza omu biro bya Solomoni yagaywaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba aina emeli zingi omu Nyanja ya Tarishishi, zasabaraga n'eza Hiramu. Omurundi gumoi omu myaka eshatu emeli zingi za Tarishishi zaletaga ezahabu, efeza, emino, enkobe n'enkoko za mugasha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Omukama Solomoni ashaga abakama bona b'ensi omw'itunga n'obumanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yona yagonzaga muno kwija kumubona n'okuhulira obumanyi bwo Ruhanga yabaire amutungire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omoi omuli abo yaletaga ebigemurobye, ebintu by'efeza n'eby'ezahabu, ebijwaro, mira, ebirungo, efarasi n'enyumbu, bingi bityo buli mwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni akatunga amagali g'endashana n'ab'efarasi. Akaba aina amagali 1,400, n'ab'efarasi 12,000. Akabata omu bigo by'amagali, abandi yaikaraga nabo Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
